          "id": "catalog.searchorwindow.basic",
          "label": "Staged basic OR search",
          "kind": "feature_group",
          "status": "first_pass",
          "exactBehavior": "Shift+Enter accumulates unique, human-sorted terms without changing the active search; the draft is a first results row skipped by initial selection when another result is available. Normal selection commits the OR, own one-term selection unwraps it. The OR button opens a fresh staged child in caller file/tag context; 0/1/many terms clear input/unwrap/create OR as recorded. The child reuses native read tabs, system editor and nested OR input. Accepted typed ORs reach actual file queries and favourite persistence.",
