        {
          "id": "catalog.searchorwindow.construction",
          "label": "Shift+Enter / draft results / rewind / cancel",
          "kind": "feature_group",
          "status": "first_pass",
          "exactBehavior": "Visible rewind with multiple terms removes the last sorted member and clears input without changing active search. Empty-input Escape rewinds, then cancels a one-term draft; nonempty input does not consume Escape as a rewind. Native keyboard and modal/caller guards keep drafts separate from committed searches. Cancel discards OR construction and clears input while leaving active search and paused results intact. Cancel on basic or advanced child preserves the caller text and predicates; cancelled ancestors close descendants and invalidate retained callbacks. Hidden/stale callers cannot apply a child; reopening creates an empty independent editor.",
