        {
          "id": "catalog.searchorwindow.advanced",
          "label": "Boolean input / preview / validation / Apply",
          "kind": "feature_group",
          "status": "first_pass",
          "exactBehavior": "Advanced mode exposes a staged Boolean input dialog, live preview and recorded invalid-input veto. The grammar implements not/and/or/implies/xor/xnor/nand/nor and symbolic aliases, parentheses, escaping, precedence, CNF distribution, duplicate-clause and tautology handling, namespaces/wildcards and supported system predicates. Negated system terms reject with the actual reference message. Accepted predicates reach real AND/OR file queries; Cancel and stale handles leave the caller intact.",
